lue":"91.2%"}],"s":"HUDCO","sec":"Financial Services","sec2":"Financial Services","sections":{"bull_bear":[{"body":"- 75% Government of India ownership underpins the institution's public-policy mandate alongside its \"Profitability with Social Justice\" motto.\n- H1 FY27 interim dividend of 26% (₹1.25 + ₹1.35 per share) declared, continuing a multi-year dividend track record.\n- Explicit target of Zero Net NPA reflects a conservative capital-protection philosophy, supported by a well-capitalised capital adequacy position.\n- Uses differentiated capital-raising instruments — Capital Gain (54EC) bonds and zero-coupon bonds — as part of its funding and shareholder-return strategy.","src":"deck","title":"Capital allocation policy (investor deck)"}],"business":[{"body":"- Techno-financial institution with 56+ years of expertise, a Navratna CPSE registered with RBI as an NBFC-IFC, and 75% owned by the Government of India.\n- One-stop-solution model spanning Financing, Consultancy and Capacity Building for housing and infrastructure projects.\n- Strong State Government partnerships and a key role in national missions (PMAY 2.0, UCF, Smart City, AMRUT, Jal Jeevan Mission).\n- Highest credit ratings positioned as a competitive edge: domestic AAA from all four agencies and sovereign-aligned international ratings.\n- Pristine asset quality (lowest NPA, high provision coverage) cited as a structural strength versus peers.","src":"deck","title":"Positioning (investor deck)"},{"body":"- [Macro context] Deck cites World Bank estimates of US$2.4 trillion+ urban investment needed by 2050 and 951 million projected urban residents, framing the scale of opportunity for HUDCO's lending business.\n- [Repurposing] A 2025 'Repurposing of HUDCO' initiative (optimizing resources, recycling/redeploying funds, strengthening financial capacity, enhancing operational efficiency, strategic partnerships) marks a strategic pivot beyond traditional housing finance toward being an infrastructure-financing and advisory platform.\n- [Recognition] Multiple external honours cited (BML Munjal Award, PSE Excellence Award 2025, Asset Triple A 'Best sustainability loan' in South Asia, GRIHA Award, among others) as third-party validation of governance, ESG and project execution.","src":"deck","title":"Notable from the deck"}]},"sources":["investor presentation 05-11-2026","structured quarterly financials"],"thesis":"HUDCO positions itself as a 56+ year techno-financial institution offering integrated financing, consultancy and capacity building for India's housing and urban infrastructure, anchored by Government ownership and strong State partnerships.","track":{"expired_n":0,"open":[],"open_total":0,"quarters_n":0,"revisions":[],"verdicts":[],"verdicts_total":0},"val5":[{"de":4.25,"fy":"FY22","mcap":6556,"opm":99.0,"pe":3.8,"roe":12.4},{"de":4.07,"fy":"FY23","mcap":8658,"opm":96.6,"pe":5.1,"roe":11.4},{"de":4.45,"fy":"FY24","mcap":37486,"opm":100.4,"pe":17.7,"roe":13.2},{"de":5.97,"fy":"FY25","mcap":39928,"opm":100.8,"pe":14.7,"roe":15.7},{"de":6.45,"fy":"FY26","mcap":35291,"opm":91.2,"pe":8.7,"roe":20.2}],"wtt":null},"drhp":{"rpt":{"financials":{"_source":"ledger","balance_sheet_key":[{"fy":"FY2019","basis":"Consolidated","total_assets_amount_rs":728283300000,"networth_amount_rs":109547600000,"equity_share_capital_amount_rs":20019000000,"other_equity_amount_rs":89528600000,"inventory_amount_rs":0,"cash_amount_rs":1111000000,"net_fixed_assets_amount_rs":499500000,"cwip_amount_rs":385900000},{"fy":"FY2020","basis":"Consolidated","total_assets_amount_rs":761257600000,"networth_amount_rs":123422600000,"equity_share_capital_amount_rs":20019000000,"other_equity_amount_rs":103403600000,"inventory_amount_rs":0,"cash_amount_rs":2226700000,"net_fixed_assets_amount_rs":452700000,"cwip_amount_rs":515600000},{"fy":"FY2021","basis":"Consolidated","total_assets_amount_rs":769577400000,"networth_amount_rs":131877400000,"equity_share_capital_amount_rs":20019000000,"other_equity_amount